+// SeekGate detects backward seeks on a replay stream. A live run publishes
+// strictly increasing ticks; the replay control plane (demosrv
+// /api/replay/ctl/seek) restarts publication at a LOWER tick, and paused
+// replay republishes the SAME tick. Only the decrease is a seek: the gate
